"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-ties-that-bind-us/\" title=\"The Ties That Bind Us\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/04/the-ties-that-bind-us-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Festivals &amp; Series</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 4 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/the-ties-that-bind-us/\" title=\"The Ties That Bind Us\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">The Ties That Bind Us</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    Valeria Bruni Tedeschi delivers a brilliant performance as Sandra, a 50-something, independent woman who works in a feminist bookstore, has no children by choice, and&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/linda-linda-linda/\" title=\"Linda Linda Linda\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/linda-linda-linda-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Special Screenings</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 11 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/linda-linda-linda/\" title=\"Linda Linda Linda\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Linda Linda Linda</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    For Kei, Kyoko, and Nozomi, their dream of playing the final high school concert together is dashed when their lead vocalist quits the band. Desperate,&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ancestral-hauntings-short-film-programme-qa/\" title=\"Ancestral Hauntings: Short Film Programme + Q&#038;A\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/ancestral-hauntings-short-film-programme-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Special Screenings</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                Sat 11 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/ancestral-hauntings-short-film-programme-qa/\" title=\"Ancestral Hauntings: Short Film Programme + Q&#038;A\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Ancestral Hauntings: Short Film Programme + Q&#038;A</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    + Q&amp;A with the filmmakers                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/backrooms/\" title=\"Backrooms\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/backrooms-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 3 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/backrooms/\" title=\"Backrooms\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Backrooms</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    In the basement of a furniture showroom, Clark (Chiwetel Ejiofor) stumbles upon a strange doorway that leads into a mysterious, otherworldly labyrinth... Endless yellow corridors&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/persepolis/\" title=\"Persepolis\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/persepolis-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div clas