\"A Private Life\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">A Private Life</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    When sophisticated psychiatrist Lilian Steiner (Jodie Foster) learns of the death of one of her patients, she is deeply troubled. Convinced it was murder, she&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/deadly-circuit/\" title=\"Deadly Circuit\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/04/deadly-circuit-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Classics</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 12 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/deadly-circuit/\" title=\"Deadly Circuit\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Deadly Circuit</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    The Eye, a private investigator (Michel Serrault) becomes obsessed with the target of his investigation, a serial killer whom he suspects is his disappeared daughter&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/acting-2/\" title=\"Acting\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/acting-2-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 5 June            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__content\" style=\"justify-content: space-between\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/acting-2/\" title=\"Acting\" target=\"_blank\">\n                <h3 class=\"card__title\">Acting</h3>\n                <div class=\"card__text\">\n                    An immersive documentary in the world of theatre company Cheek by Jowl from acclaimed director Sophie Fiennes (Grace Jones: Bloodlight and Bami, A Pervert’s Guide&hellip;                </div>\n            </a>\n\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card card--horizontal card--film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/blue-heron/\" title=\"Blue Heron\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <div class=\"card__thumbnail\" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/blue-heron-460x275.jpg' );\"></div>\n    </a>\n\n    <div class=\"card__information\">\n        <div class=\"card__metadata\">\n                        <div class=\"card__terms\">\n                                <div class=\"tag\">Films</div>\n                                <div class=\"tag\">New Releases</div>\n                            </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card__dates\">\n                From 10 July            </div>\n                    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card__con