://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/regal-gals-shorts.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/regal-gals-shorts.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Regal Gals Shorts</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Regal Gals Shorts</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Sun 28 Jun to Sat 11 Jul</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    CinéFamilies\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/relaxed-screenings/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Relaxed Screenings\">\n\t\t                    \tRelaxed Screenings\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Come and enjoy a programme of French short films in which 9-year-old girls are gloriously leading the way. Differences and new environments don’t seem to stop these regal gals!</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Relaxed Screening</h2>\r\n<p><strong>The screening on 28 June is a special relaxed screening designed for children with sensory difficulties.</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tvarious\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFRA | 2021-2022\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t79 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tin French with EN subs\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-07-11\">\n\t                Saturday 11 July\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière II</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"14:00\">\n\t            14:00\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6921133.TcsSection_3841519\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"film-additional-information\">\n\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Programme</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Luisa and the Feathered Snake</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tHefang Wei\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tFRA | 2021\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>9-year-old Luisa has just moved to Mexico City. When Keza, her beloved lizard, escapes in the streets of the city, Luisa goes looking for him and meets Arturo. Together with the wrestler Diego, the two children will pursue Keza and allow him to be reincarnated as the Mexican god, Quetzalcoatl.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Mussels &amp; Fries</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tNicolas Hu \t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tFRA | 2021\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>Noée, a 9-year-old girl, just joined her mother on the island of Bénac’h in Brittany. She discovers that all of the kids here have known each other forever and that they all know how to sail. And Noée wants to try it! But her mother doesn’t have the means to sign her up for sailing class.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Immobile Stars</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tNoémi Gruner & Anna Frégonèse \t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tFRA | 2022\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>Chenghua, aged 9, is preparing a school project on space travel with her best friend. She cannot find enough time to do this as she is constantly asked to translate for her parents. They do not speak French and are dependent on their child and do not realise that they are putting too much weight on her young shoulders. Chenghua can take no more and tries to break free from her family. Her desire for space and natural enthusiasm will help her take those steps.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\t</section>\n\t\n\t</div>\n\n<div class='yarpp yarpp-related yarpp-related-website yarpp-template-yarpp-template-ifru'>\n</div>\n<section class=\"call-block cafe-restaurant\">\n\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"calls-to-action trio\">\n    <div class=\"inner\">\n    \t<div class=\"primary\">\n    \t\t    \t\t<div class=\"call-to-action \" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/regal-gals-shorts-1024x469.jpg' );\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\" title=\"Gazette Brasserie\">\n\t                <h4>Gazette Brasserie</h4>\n\t                <p>London's most authentic Brasserie</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n    \t</div>\n    \t<div class=\"secondary\">\n\t    \t\t        <div class=\"call-to-action format-classic scheme-brick\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/25-under/\" title=\"25 &amp; Under\">\n\t                <h4>25 & Under</h4>\n\t                <p>If you love cinema, and you’re 25 or under, you're in for a treat!</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n\t        \t        <div class=\"call-to-action format-hollow scheme-blue\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/membership/\" title=\"Become a Member\">\n\t                <h4>Become a Member</h4>\n\t                <p>Enjoy unique events and benefits</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n\t        \t    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"share\">\n  