6\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\"><span>Gazette Brasserie</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"42568\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/ticket-prices/\"><span>Ticket Prices</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/ancestral-hauntings-short-film-programme.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/ancestral-hauntings-short-film-programme.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Ancestral Hauntings: Short Film Programme + Q&#038;A</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Ancestral Hauntings: Short Film Programme + Q&#038;A</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">Sat 11 Jul</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Special Screenings\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>London Indian Film Festival is delighted to present a compelling programme of short films by exciting filmmakers of South Asian origin, exploring ancestry, heritage, and the lasting impact of colonialism. Examining race, prejudice, and lineage, the films explore how the spectres of colonialism linger through language, touch, and songs of resistance. A range of distinct stories reflect on how colonial legacies percolate through generations and haunt across distance.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Special Screening</h2>\r\n<p><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW8072064 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW8072064 BCX0\">The screening will be followed by a Q&amp;A with the filmmakers.</span></span></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tVarious\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t2026 | UK\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t60 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEnglish, Urdu, Tamil with English subtitles\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-07-11\">\n\t                Saturday 11 July\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t            \t\t        <span class=\"calendar-note\">+ Q&A</span>\n\t\t    \t           \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"20:30\">\n\t            20:30\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6878468.TcsSection_1928774\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"film-additional-information\">\n\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Films in the programme:</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>The Curfew</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tShehrezad Maher\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tUnited States | 2025\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDuration:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\t19 mins\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tLanguage:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tEnglish, Urdu with English subtitles\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>When Ayaan becomes a temporary caregiver for his grandmother, they find themselves adrift in the gulf of a language barrier. In the silence, spectres of a colonial past shift how he sees strangers and himself.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Haunted Heritage</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tSurina Narula\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tUnited Kingdom | 2026\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDuration:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\t15 mins\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tLanguage:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tEnglish\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>A woman moves into a mansion, only to find it is haunted by the ghost of an elderly matron, who forces her to confront her own prejudices. The film explores how inherited privilege and unexamined racism persist across cultures and how the ghosts we fight often mirror the ones we carry within.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Sugarcane, Burning</h5>\n<p><ul class=\"attributes__list\">\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDirector(s):\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tTashin Singh\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tCountry, year:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tSouth Africa, United Kingdom | 2026\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tDuration:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\t17 mins\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i>\n\t\t\t\tLanguage:\n\t\t\t</strong>\n\t\t\tEnglish, Tamil with English subtitles\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n</p>\n<p>A young woman stands at the threshold of motherhood, suspended between what she has inherited and what she will pass on. Rooted in the historical migration of thousands of Indians to Southern Africa as indentured labourers in the nineteenth century, the film swims through the invisible weight of language, memory and home, as carried through generations.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\t</section>\n\t\n\t</div>\n\n<div class='yarpp yarpp-related yarpp-related-website yarpp-template-yarpp-template-ifru'>\n\n<section class=\"related-posts\">\n    <div class=\"inner\">\n        <h2 class=\"title\">See also</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"cards__wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"cards\">\n            <article class=\"card film\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/in-short-europe-best-of-best/\" title=\"In Short, Europe: Best of Best\" class=\"card__link\">\n        <div class=\"thumbnail\">