-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/backrooms.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bdPswk-WHHo&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"bdPswk-WHHo\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/backrooms.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bdPswk-WHHo&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Backrooms</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Backrooms</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Fri 03 to Sun 26 Jul</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    New Releases\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>In the basement of a furniture showroom, Clark (Chiwetel Ejiofor) stumbles upon a strange doorway that leads into a mysterious, otherworldly labyrinth&#8230; Endless yellow corridors stretch in every direction, spaces feel eerily abandoned, and the rules of the world begin to collapse. As his therapist (Renate Reinsve) searches for answers, the deeper she ventures into the backrooms, the more uncertain the nature of the threat becomes… A cultural phenomenon and one of the most unique cinematic events of the year, <em>Backroom</em> is 20-year-old Kane Parson’s first film, based on web series of the same name.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tKane Parsons\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tChiwetel Ejiofor, Renate Reinsve, Lukita Maxwell, Finn Bennett, Mark Duplass, Avan Jogia\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUSA | 2026\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t105 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn English\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t15\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-07-11\">\n\t                Saturday 11 July\t          