p.lu/lp/07yv7/a-wyJBoRgwLCw8UAavq1u\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Subscribe to our newsletter\">\n        Subscribe to our newsletter        <i class=\"ri-mail-add-line\"></i>\n    </a>\n</div>        </div>\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"secondary\">\n                <div class=\"description\">\n            <div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>The Institut français du Royaume-Uni promotes the best of <strong>French culture</strong> and language and encourages <strong>cross-cultural exchanges</strong> from both sides of the Channel.</p></div>        </div>\n                        <ol>\n        <li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-type-post_type menu-variation-header\"><a data-page-id=\"178\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>About Us</span></a><button class=\"sub-menu-toggle\" title=\"Toggle the submenu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"icon icon-chevron-down-regular\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"44412\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>In a Few Words</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"45502\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/#in-figures\"><span>In Figures</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"616\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/team/\"><span>The Team</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"44414\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>The Institut français in the World</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"614\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/press-room/\"><span>Press Room</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"618\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/jobs-applications/\"><span>Jobs &amp; Applications</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"620\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/useful-links/\"><span>Useful Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-type-post_type menu-variation-header\"><a data-page-id=\"624\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/\"><span>Visit &#038; Contact Us</span></a><button class=\"sub-menu-toggle\" title=\"Toggle the submenu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"icon icon-chevron-down-regular\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"624\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/\"><span>Visit &#038; Contact Us</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"626\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\"><span>Gazette Brasserie</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"42568\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/ticket-prices/\"><span>Ticket Prices</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/persepolis.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pr-ffssDVgI&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"pr-ffssDVgI\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/persepolis.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pr-ffssDVgI&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Persepolis</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Persepolis</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Sat 27 Jun to Sun 26 Jul</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    CinéFamilies\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                \t<a href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/festivals-and-series/highlights-of-the-month/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Highlights of the Month\">\n\t\t                    \tHighlights of the Month\t\t                    </a>\n\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Based on Marjane Satrapi’s graphic novel of the same name, <em>Persepolis</em> follows her life in pre- and post-revolutionary Iran and then in Europe. This poignant coming-of-age story of a precocious and outspoken young Iranian girl that begins during the Islamic Revolution, is the chronicle of a girlhood and adolescence at once outrageous and familiar; a young life entwined with the history of her country yet filled with the universal trials and joys of growing up.</p>\n<p><strong>These screenings of <em>Persepolis</em> pay tribute to the late Marjane Satrapi who left us this June.</strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Special Offer</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Calling all parents and guardians! Tickets for accompanying adults are £6 when bought with one or more tickets for children for this film. Simply add the kids and your ticket (Standard/Member/Concession) to the basket and the discount will automatically be applied at the checkout.</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMarjane Satrapi & Vincent Paronnaud\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tChiara Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, Danielle Darrieux, Simon Abkarian\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFRA/USA | 2007\t\t\t\t\t</li>