_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-right\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/acting-2.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3CC5HQTUJ0&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"C3CC5HQTUJ0\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-right\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/03/acting-2.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3CC5HQTUJ0&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Acting</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Acting</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">From Fri 05 Jun to Sun 12 Jul</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    New Releases\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>An immersive documentary in the world of theatre company Cheek by Jowl from acclaimed director Sophie Fiennes (<em>Grace Jones: Bloodlight and Bami, A Pervert’s Guide to Cinema</em>), looking in depth at the acting process, from voice exercises to text analysis and the immersion in performance. In an old castle, theatre director Declan Donnellan leads a dozen young actors as they work on Shakespeare’s <em>Macbeth</em>. His insights unlock their imagination and help them find their own way through this challenging text. Full of wit, often funny, this film is as inspiring as it is a celebration of artistic collaboration and a reminder of the enduring strength of classic plays.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Special Screening</h3>\r\n<p><strong>The screening on 5 June will be followed by a discussion with actor Orlando James, actor and director Ralph Fiennes, and Declan Donnellan and Nick Ormerod (Cheek by Jowl).</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>The event will conclude with a book signing by Declan Donellan of his books <em>The Actor and the Target </em>and <em>The Actor and the Space,</em> with copies available for purchase onsite.</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSophie Fiennes\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tOrlando James\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUK | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t145 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn English\t\t