onditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/a-goodnight-kiss.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mlyhvQZj6TA&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox=\"mlyhvQZj6TA\">\n            \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n            </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/a-goodnight-kiss.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"button--play slide__play\" aria-label=\"Play this video\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mlyhvQZj6TA&autoplay=1\" title=\"Play this video\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-fancybox>\n        \t<i class=\"ri-play-circle-line\"></i>\n        </a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">A Goodnight Kiss</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>A Goodnight Kiss</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">Tue 15 Sep</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Special Screenings\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>A remarkable woman and leading voice in Lithuania’s culture, Irena Veisaitė lived through the atrocities of two totalitarian regimes, coming out on the other side believing life should be radiant. A deeply personal, nuanced portrait of Irena, the film is a testimony to her humanity, vigour, and courage to live and to forgive. Irena passed away in 2020, early in the film’s production. This led director Giedrė Žickytė to find new ways to bring her story to life, exploring its emotional and historical contours through footage from Irena’s final year, unseen archives, echoing her memory. Music by her lifelong friend and celebrated composer Arvo Pärt flows through the narrative, evoking reflections on loss and the enduring power of love.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Special Screening</h2>\r\n<p><strong>The screening will be followed by a Q&amp;A with director Giedrė Žickytė</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGiedrė Žickytė\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIrena Veisaitė\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-film-line\"></i> Original title: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIrena\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tLithuania/Estonia/Bulgaria | 2025\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t87 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn Lithuanian, English, German, Russian, Estonian with EN subtitles\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-09-15\">\n\t                Tuesday 15 September\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t            \t\t        <span class=\"calendar-note\">+ Q&A</span>\n\t\t    \t           \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"18:00\">\n\t            18:00\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6942702.TcsSection_6930861\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"film-partners\">\n\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p><strong>In partnership with the Lithuanian Embassy</strong></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-56530 \" src=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/Logo_Lithuanian_embassy-300x135.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"255\" height=\"115\" srcset=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/Logo_Lithuanian_embassy-300x135.jpg 300w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/Logo_Lithuanian_embassy-1024x462.jpg 1024w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/Logo_Lithuanian_embassy-768x346.jpg 768w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/Logo_Lithuanian_embassy.jpg 1521w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 255px) 100vw, 255px\" /></p></div>\t</section>\n\t</div>\n\n<div class='yarpp yarpp-related yarpp-related-website yarpp-related-none yarpp-template-yarpp-template-ifru'>\n</div>\n<section class=\"call-block cafe-