ges <strong>cross-cultural exchanges</strong> from both sides of the Channel.</p></div>        </div>\n                        <ol>\n        <li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-type-post_type menu-variation-header\"><a data-page-id=\"178\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>About Us</span></a><button class=\"sub-menu-toggle\" title=\"Toggle the submenu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"icon icon-chevron-down-regular\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"44412\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>In a Few Words</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"45502\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/#in-figures\"><span>In Figures</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"616\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/team/\"><span>The Team</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-type-custom\"><a data-page-id=\"44414\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/\"><span>The Institut français in the World</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"614\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/press-room/\"><span>Press Room</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"618\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/jobs-applications/\"><span>Jobs &amp; Applications</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"620\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/about-us/useful-links/\"><span>Useful Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-type-post_type menu-variation-header\"><a data-page-id=\"624\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/\"><span>Visit &#038; Contact Us</span></a><button class=\"sub-menu-toggle\" title=\"Toggle the submenu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"icon icon-chevron-down-regular\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"624\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/\"><span>Visit &#038; Contact Us</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"626\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\"><span>Gazette Brasserie</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"42568\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/ticket-prices/\"><span>Ticket Prices</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"630\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/terms-conditions/\"><span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"43737\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cookies-policy/\"><span>Privacy &amp; Cookies Policy</span></a></li>\n\t<li tabindex=\"0\"  class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-type-post_type\"><a data-page-id=\"632\"  href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/faq/\"><span>FAQ</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n        </ul>\n            </div>\n    </nav></header>        <main id=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"film\">\n\t<section class=\"film-introduction\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"desktop leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide active position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/algiers.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section><section class=\"mobile leaderboard \">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"slide  active\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"slide__illustration slide__illustration--mobile  position-middle-center\" style=\"--background: url('https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/algiers.jpg')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-context\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-dates\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk\" title=\"Home\">\n                Home            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Films\">\n                Films            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/whats-on/\" title=\"What&#8217;s On\">\n                What&#8217;s On            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/cinema/\" title=\"Ciné Lumière\">\n                Ciné Lumière            </a>\n            </li>\n        <li class=\"item\">\n                    <span class=\"link current\">Algiers</span>\n            </li>\n    </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Algiers</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"start\">Sun 27 Sep</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t            \t\t            <div class=\"tags\">\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Films\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \t\t                <div class=\"tags__tag tag\">\n\t\t                    Special Screenings\t\t                </div>\n\t\t                \n\t\t                \t\t            </div>\n\t\t            \t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"definition\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>A gripping Algerian mystery thriller, <em>Algiers</em> follows the investigation into the abduction of a young girl, an event that sends fear, suspicion and anger through the city. As public tension rises, police inspector Sami Sadoudi and trauma psychiatrist Dr Dounia Assam are drawn into a case that forces them to confront not only the crime itself, but also the unresolved shadows of Algeria’s past.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Written and directed by Chakib Taleb-Bendiab, <em>Algiers</em> marks a powerful debut feature, combining the urgency of a police thriller with a deeper reflection on memory, trauma and social fracture. Set against the charged atmosphere of the Algerian capital, the film offers a tense, emotionally layered portrait of a society still carrying the weight of history. <em>Algiers</em> represented Algeria at the Oscars for Best International Feature.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"information\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Special Screening</h2>\r\n<p><strong>The screening will be followed by a Q&amp;A with director Chakib Taleb-Bendiab, moderated by film critic and journalist Linda Marric</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"metadata\" style=\"background: #3558a2;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-vidicon-2-line\"></i> Director(s): </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tChakib Taleb-Bendiab\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-team-line\"></i> Cast: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMeriem Medjkane, Nabil Asli, Hichem Mesbah\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-film-line\"></i> Original title: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAlger\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-map-pin-line\"></i> Country, year: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAlgeria/France/Tunisia | 2024\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-time-line\"></i> Duration: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t93 mins\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-chat-1-line\"></i> Language: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIn Arabic & French with EN subtitles\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"display: block;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><i class=\"ri-settings-line\"></i> Cert.: </strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTBC\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</header>\n\t</section>\n\n\t\t<section class=\"next-showing\">\n\t\t<h2>Next Showing</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"timetable\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-09-27\">\n\t                Sunday 27 September\t            </time>\n\t                            <span class=\"location\">Ciné Lumière</span>\n\t            \t                       \t</div>\n\n\t        \t        <time class=\"time\" datetime=\"18:00\">\n\t            18:00\t        </time>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"actions\">\n\t    \t<a href=\"https://cinelumiere.savoysystems.co.uk/CineLumiere.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_600.TcsWebTab_601.TcsPerformance_6919311.TcsSection_6930861\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Book now\" class=\"button button-arrow\">Book now</a>\n\t    \t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<section class=\"film-partners\">\n\t\t<div class=\"content-block rte\"><p>Presented as part of <strong>DzFest 2026</strong>, the UK Algerian Festival for Arts &amp; Culture, this special screening at Ciné Lumière celebrates contemporary Algerian cinema and its growing international voice.</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-56533 \" src=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/dzfest-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/dzfest-300x300.png 300w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/dzfest-150x150.png 150w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/dzfest-120x120.png 120w, https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/dzfest.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\t</section>\n\t</div>\n\n<div class='yarpp yarpp-related yarpp-related-website yarpp-related-none yarpp-template-yarpp-template-ifru'>\n</div>\n<section class=\"call-block cafe-restaurant\">\n\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"calls-to-action trio\">\n    <div class=\"inner\">\n    \t<div class=\"primary\">\n    \t\t    \t\t<div class=\"call-to-action \" style=\"--background: url( 'https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/app/uploads/2026/06/algiers-1024x469.jpg' );\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/visit-contact-us/cafe-restaurant/\" title=\"Gazette Brasserie\">\n\t                <h4>Gazette Brasserie</h4>\n\t                <p>London's most authentic Brasserie</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n    \t</div>\n    \t<div class=\"secondary\">\n\t    \t\t        <div class=\"call-to-action format-classic scheme-brick\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/25-under/\" title=\"25 &amp; Under\">\n\t                <h4>25 & Under</h4>\n\t                <p>If you love cinema, and you’re 25 or under, you're in for a treat!</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n\t        \t        <div class=\"call-to-action format-hollow scheme-blue\">\n\t            <div class=\"inner\">\n\t                <a class=\"call__link\" href=\"https://www.institut-francais.org.uk/membership/\" title=\"Become a Member\">\n\t                <h4>Become a Member</h4>\n\t                <p>Enjoy unique events and benefits</p>\n\n\t                </a> \t            </div>\n\t        </div>\n\t        \t    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"share\">\n    <h3>Share this</h3>\n    <ul class=\"share__list\">\n            <li class=\"share__item bluesky-fill share__item--tiktok\">\n            <a class=\"share__item__link share__item__link--tiktok\" href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/frenchinstituteuk.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Send on Bluesky\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n                <i class=\"ri-bluesky-fill\"></i>\n                <span class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Send this post on Bluesky</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n            <li class=\"share__item twitter-x-fill share__item--twitter\">\n            <a class=\"share__item__link share__item__link--twitter\" href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Algiers https%3A%2F%2Fwww.institut-francais.org.uk%2Fcinema%2Falgiers%2F\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tweet on X\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n                <i class=\"ri-twitter-x-fill\"></i>\n                <span class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Tweet this post on X</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n            <li class=\"share__item facebook-fill share__item--facebook\">\n            <a class=\"share__item__link share__i